<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">CAMPUS FAVORITES</view><view class="title">校园好味榜</view><view class="subtitle">每天一人一票，支持你喜欢的食堂味道。</view><view class="chips"><view wx:for="{{tabs}}" wx:key="id" class="chip {{tab===item.id?'on':''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="tab">{{item.name}}</view></view><view class="panel"><view class="record row" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id"><text class="rank-number">{{index+1}}</text><text>{{item.emoji}}</text><view class="grow"><view>{{item.name}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.metric}}</view></view><button wx:if="{{tab==='dishes'}}" class="small" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="vote" disabled="{{!!votedId}}">{{votedId===item.id?'✓ 今日已投':votedId?'今天已投票':'投票 ♡'}}</button></view></view><view class="notice">人气按累计票数排序；好评只统计审核通过的评价；拥挤度只看15分钟内有效上报。</view><view class="owner">模块负责人 · 杨铭宇</view></view>
